IMPORT `homecare-definitions`
IMPORT `homecare-general-exclusions`
IMPORT `homecare-general-conditions`

-- Liberty HomeCare (UW-RPP-W-001-06-V), Part 2, Personal and Family Liability (PHẦN 2 -
-- TRÁCH NHIỆM CÁ NHÂN VÀ GIA ĐÌNH): the insuring clause and costs, the Limits, the
-- Jurisdiction clause, the Additional Definitions, the tenant's liability Extension,
-- Exclusions 1-17 and Conditions 1-3. Quotations (`src:N`) are line N of
-- ../../source/raw/liberty-homecare.txt.

§ `Part 2. Personal and Family Liability`

DECLARE `A ground under Part 2` IS ONE OF
    `Introduction: cover had not attached`
    `Part 2 is not insured: the Summary states no Limit of Liability`
    `the person held liable is not an Insured under Part 2`
    `there is no personal legal liability`
    `the liability is not for death, bodily injury or property damage`
    `the event was not an Occurrence: expected or intended by the Insured`
    `the Occurrence was not in the Period of Insurance`
    `the Occurrence was not at or near the Insured Location`
    `not connected with the ownership or use of the Home`
    `Jurisdiction: not a first-instance judgment of a competent Vietnamese court`
    `Part 2 exclusion 1: intentional or negligent act, with foreseeable consequences`
    `Part 2 exclusion 2: liability assumed by agreement`
    `Part 2 exclusion 3: injury to a Family member or a person usually residing with the Insured`
    `Part 2 exclusion 4: injury to an employee in the course of work`
    `Part 2 exclusion 5: workers' compensation`
    `Part 2 exclusion 6: property owned or controlled by the Insured, Family, residents or employees`
    `Part 2 exclusion 7: business, trade or profession`
    `Part 2 exclusion 8: construction, alteration or repair`
    `Part 2 exclusion 9: aircraft, vessels, vehicles or internet communication`
    `Part 2 exclusion 10: communicable disease`
    `Part 2 exclusion 11: use other than as a private residence`
    `Part 2 exclusion 12: the cost of the Insured's own work`
    `Part 2 exclusion 13: products no longer in the Insured's control`
    `Part 2 exclusion 13 proviso: every possible precaution with food and drink not taken`
    `Part 2 exclusion 14: professional advice or services`
    `Part 2 exclusion 15: pollution or contamination`
    `Part 2 exclusion 16: fines, penalties or liquidated damages`
    `Part 2 exclusion 17: punitive, exemplary or multiplied damages`
    `a General Exclusion` HAS `which` IS A `A General Exclusion`
    `a General Condition` HAS `which` IS A `A ground under the General Conditions`

§§ `Scope of cover`

-- The Insured and any member of the Insured's Family, for any claim for which either is
-- personally legally liable for (a) death of or bodily injury to any person, (b) loss,
-- destruction of or damage to property, arising from an Occurrence at or near the Insured
-- Location in the period of insurance and connected with the ownership or use of the Home.
-- In this Part the Home includes the land, trees, shrubs and other plants grown at the
-- Insured Location as part of it.
