-- "Sự Cố" (Occurrence): an event the Insured neither expects nor intends, including
-- continuous or repeated exposure to substantially the same conditions, resulting in Bodily
-- Injury and/or Property Damage covered by the policy. Bodily Injury includes death, illness,
-- disability, fright, shock, mental anguish or nervous injury; Property Damage is physical
-- damage to or destruction of tangible property, including resulting loss of use, or loss of
-- use of undamaged tangible property caused by an Occurrence.
