-- src:563 | trang trí cho Địa Điểm Bảo Hiểm;
-- 9. from ownership, maintenance, design, custody or use of (a) aircraft or aerial devices
-- (except model aircraft or toy kites), airfields; (b) motor boats or vessels, jetties or
-- moorings; (c) mechanically propelled vehicles licensed for road use or requiring
-- compulsory insurance, or loading or unloading them; (d) email, advertising or any
-- internet-based communication.
