GIVETH A DEONTIC `A party` `An act under the policy`
`Part 2: the Insurer may take over the claim, or pay the limit or less and be discharged` MEANS
        (PARTY `the Insurer` MAY `take over the defence or settlement of the claim`)
    ROR (PARTY `the Insurer` MAY `pay the limit or a lesser sum in settlement`)
